        "slc_f52d703b5418833c4da112d438762a3122d40ede17b59412a4dafc555978dee4"
      ],
      "text": "The codebase is organized into three layers plus a community area: src/foundation (core primitives), src/agent (agent loop), src/coding (coding agent), and src/community (third-party integrations such as OpenAI)."
    },
    {
