        "slc_6820bc1c8988742eca0c2ebe001909c8e835a49bea1602bcbfaf4706fb3b9d17"
      ],
      "text": "The agent loop is ReAct-style: it maintains conversation state, orchestrates think-act-observe steps, invokes tool calls in parallel, and feeds observations back into the next reasoning step."
    },
