      ],
      "text": "A middleware system lets extensions observe and mutate agent behavior at eight lifecycle hooks (beforeAgentRun/afterAgentRun, beforeAgentStep/afterAgentStep, beforeModel/afterModel, beforeToolUse/afterToolUse), invoked sequentially in array order; hooks may return a partial update to merge or void."
