        "slc_4b0c89cc0b68bbf73b726100ec37a0353479f8d2d76cc4784be25fcc27f2f2b5"
      ],
      "text": "Bun was chosen over Node for its native async/await concurrency, faster HTTP/filesystem/cold-start performance, single-file compiled executables via 'bun build --compile', and bundled test runner, bundler, and TypeScript support."
    },
